                <h1 class="ink-write ink-delay-1 font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-[#1e1b18] leading-[1.08] tracking-tight">
                  A Proposal in <span class="text-[#a61c1c] italic">Solidarity</span>
                </h1>

                <!-- Animated Fountain Pen Underline SVG -->
                <svg class="w-64 sm:w-80 h-4 overflow-visible" viewBox="0 0 320 16" fill="none">
                  <path class="pen-stroke pen-stroke-delay-1" d="M3 11 C 75 4, 195 14, 316 6" stroke="#a61c1c" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                  <path class="pen-stroke pen-stroke-delay-2" d="M24 15 C 110 11, 210 15, 285 12" stroke="#1e1b18" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.6"/>
                </svg>

                <p class="ink-write ink-delay-2 text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#2d2722] leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
                  An open letter from the <strong class="font-semibold">Democratic Socialists of America Education Foundation</strong> inviting <strong class="text-[#a61c1c] font-semibold">Three Avenues Bookshop</strong> to become a Founding Partner of the citywide <strong class="underline decoration-[#a61c1c]/50 underline-offset-4">Solidarity Book Club Union</strong>.
                </p>

                <div class="ink-write ink-delay-3 pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
                  <button onclick="nextSlide()" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-[#1e1b18] hover:bg-[#a61c1c] text-[#f8f2e4] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-serif-book text-base sm:text-lg shadow-md transition-all cursor-pointer">
